{%- comment -%}
  The pop-up (owner, 2026-11-23: "we are doing an event this Saturday ... figure out somewhere we can
  showcase this and do the promotion": at our place, Saturday 28 November, 1pm to 8pm, booked through its own
  Cal.com event, no offer; 2026-11-25: "we dont want to say viewing day, just say pop-up" and "create a banner
  to make this pop up look more obvious"). Theme settings → Pop-up turn it on and say when it ends; the words
  are in the language files under event. After it ends nothing here shows (the storefront page isn't cached,
  so this is worked out on every visit).

  Params: kind
    'on'    prints 1 while the pop-up is on (capture it to decide)
    'strip' the line above the masthead, on the green: Pop-up · Saturday 28 November, 1pm to 8pm · Book a time
    'hero'  the banner under the home film's words: a green card with the day, the hours, where, and a button
  Its page has the handle pop-up (viewing-day until it was renamed; both still work).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign ev_on = false
  if settings.event_on and settings.event_ends != blank
    assign ev_now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    assign ev_end = settings.event_ends | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    if ev_end > ev_now
      assign ev_on = true
    endif
  endif
  if ev_on
    assign ev_when = 'event.when' | t
    assign ev_today = 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
    if ev_today == settings.event_date
      assign ev_when = 'event.when_today' | t
    endif
    assign ev_handle = 'viewing-day'
    if pages['pop-up'].id
      assign ev_handle = 'pop-up'
    endif
    assign ev_url = routes.root_url | append: '/pages/' | append: ev_handle | replace: '//', '/'
  endif
-%}
{%- if ev_on -%}
  {%- case kind -%}
    {%- when 'on' -%}1
    {%- when 'strip' -%}
      <span class="ev-strip"><span class="ev-label">{{ 'event.label' | t }}</span> · {{ ev_when }} · <a class="ev-book" href="{{ ev_url }}">{{ 'event.book' | t }}</a></span>
    {%- when 'hero' -%}
      <div class="ev-note">
        <p class="ev-label">{{ 'event.label' | t }}</p>
        <p class="ev-when">{{ ev_when }}</p>
        <p class="ev-where">{{ 'event.where' | t }}</p>
        <a class="ev-book" href="{{ ev_url }}">{{ 'event.book' | t }}</a>
      </div>
  {%- endcase -%}
{%- endif -%}
